      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WHAT EACH TEST IS WORTH\n\nMandate fit, does it move Africa's economy forward?          counts twice\nResearch to policy, could ACET turn it into real policy?      counts twice\nAfrican traction, is there real demand on the continent?     counts once\nWhite space, is the ground open for ACET to lead?             counts once",
      "fontSize": 23,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "sD1DTQ_GtO6aRj0HFiRaA",
