      "text": "A WORKED EXAMPLE\n\nA theme marked strong on mandate fit, strong on research to policy, partial on African traction, and strong on white space:\n(3 x 2)  +  (3 x 2)  +  (2 x 1)  +  (3 x 1)  =  17 points out of a possible 18\nThe two highest-scoring themes that are new or next door to ACET's work become the two areas to enter.\nIf only one theme is worth entering, the report says one. It never invents a second to fill the space.",
      "fontSize": 23,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "-1X35Wz1T-owSkK2NDh2U",
      "originalText": "A WORKED EXAMPLE\n\nA theme marked strong on mandate fit, strong on research to policy, partial on African traction, and strong on white space:\n(3 x 2)  +  (3 x 2)  +  (2 x 1)  +  (3 x 1)  =  17 points out of a possible 18\nThe two highest-scoring themes that are new or next door to ACET's work become the two areas to enter.\nIf only one theme is worth entering, the report says one. It never invents a second to fill the space.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "pk8hvFKMPhQM-hcBPzRV6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 240.9677734375,
      "y": 3023.625,
      "width": 1478.064453125,
      "height": 28.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
