      "versionNonce": 263744514,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789763250451,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "THE RULE THE CODE ENFORCES   ·   if a theme matches work ACET already runs, it is marked existing and set to deepen, whatever the model said about it",
      "fontSize": 23,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "enR8RX7N5Fy81BJ2gatW4",
      "originalText": "THE RULE THE CODE ENFORCES   ·   if a theme matches work ACET already runs, it is marked existing and set to deepen, whatever the model said about it",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "sihVunhPERuxOY7bDOHuO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 721.009521484375,
      "y": 3361.625,
      "width": 797.98095703125,
      "height": 28.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1B",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 509717982,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 928369950,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789763250451,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "E5      Repeated. A review of many studies, or trials in two or more different countries.",
      "fontSize": 23,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "2LoqaVzG-LekGeVTMtdae",
      "originalText": "E5      Repeated. A review of many studies, or trials in two or more different countries.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "DbK1Zz-e0WFifAaMeTlQM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 558.380859375,
      "y": 3465.625,
      "width": 1053.23828125,
      "height": 28.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1C",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 267141662,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1804573634,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789763250451,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "E4      A randomized trial. People were put into the program by chance, which is the strongest test of one program.",
      "fontSize": 23,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "MDT0giGlGfO4CHRiDK1u5",
      "originalText": "E4      A randomized trial. People were put into the program by chance, which is the strongest test of one program.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "uXHAjNoch6FiTzvQrK4JQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 607.66552734375,
      "y": 3569.625,
      "width": 884.6689453125,
      "height": 28.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1D",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1402621534,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 194672990,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789763250451,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "E3      A fair comparison. The program group is compared with a similar group that did not join.",
      "fontSize": 23,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "-Ru4nfMZtzB2uHELl8toX",
      "originalText": "E3      A fair comparison. The program group is compared with a similar group that did not join.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "_jTcuhb0d9-e7IWek4kA1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 457.71044921875,
      "y": 3673.625,
      "width": 1114.5791015625,
      "height": 28.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1E",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1178391198,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1818940290,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789763250451,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "E2      A measured change, with nobody to compare against. Something moved, but we cannot say the program caused it.",
      "fontSize": 23,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "Fdygw_E5spBQ9gwBocPiH",
      "originalText": "E2      A measured change, with nobody to compare against. Something moved, but we cannot say the program caused it.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "4urB3rg6OBNul58oGDNZJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 603.5546875,
      "y": 3777.625,
      "width": 752.890625,
      "height": 28.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1F",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 42258142,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 50306462,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789763250451,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "E1      Described only. Someone says the program exists, and nothing measures it.",
      "fontSize": 23,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "3WlBsQHxr4TdZUdH8duSC",
      "originalText": "E1      Described only. Someone says the program exists, and nothing measures it.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "k__3UNcwJJce8LF8HTjdR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 99.496484375,
      "y": 3977.5,
      "width": 172.20703125,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1G",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 620970782,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1686704962,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789763250451,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "THE QUOTE MUST\nBE REAL\n\nThe sentence naming\nthe method must be\nfound word for word\nin the document.\nIf not, the grade\nfalls to E2.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "3Umx0VIzQJXtoWh2IOJ9e",
      "originalText": "THE QUOTE MUST\nBE REAL\n\nThe sentence naming\nthe method must be\nfound word for word\nin the document.\nIf not, the grade\nfalls to E2.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "P9unRK5lsCyfhnOpYui5p",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 503.94257812499995,
      "y": 3977.5,
      "width": 157.71484375,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1H",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 271134558,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1387674078,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789763250451,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "THE WORDS SET\nTHE LIMIT\n\nThe grade can be\nno higher than the\nmethod named in\nthat sentence,\nwhatever the model\nclaimed.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "rYl8FqfmjQht5a8WmX4Vr",
      "originalText": "THE WORDS SET\nTHE LIMIT\n\nThe grade can be\nno higher than the\nmethod named in\nthat sentence,\nwhatever the model\nclaimed.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "akrW96Vi0eF3p-Ti1zr22",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 874.9951171875,
      "y": 3965,
      "width": 210.009765625,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1I",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 809997214,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 105470722,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789763250451,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SOMEONE ELSE MUST\nHAVE CHECKED IT\n\nE4 and E5 need an\noutside evaluator.\nResearchers working\nwith the program\ncount. Its own website\ndoes not, unless a\njournal published it.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "YdGdm4IVkG0FbAKdflx2u",
      "originalText": "SOMEONE ELSE MUST\nHAVE CHECKED IT\n\nE4 and E5 need an\noutside evaluator.\nResearchers working\nwith the program\ncount. Its own website\ndoes not, unless a\njournal published it.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "XEyNRx67Wn1jl8Faa2UQb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1290.8328124999998,
      "y": 3977.5,
      "width": 172.734375,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1J",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1066364894,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1640975902,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789763250451,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "RESULTS,\nNOT ACTIVITY\n\nCounting people\ntrained is not a result.\nA study that counts\nonly activity, or\nreports no result yet,\nfalls to E2.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "Y-uMujr7Ea6q-IDIs591k",
      "originalText": "RESULTS,\nNOT ACTIVITY\n\nCounting people\ntrained is not a result.\nA study that counts\nonly activity, or\nreports no result yet,\nfalls to E2.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5zsLk-MXFdJFeiqmk190_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1698.5748046874999,
      "y": 4015,
      "width": 151.650390625,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1K",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 168936478,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1613408962,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789763250451,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "IT MUST BE\nTHIS PROGRAM\n\nA study of a\ndifferent program\ncounts for nothing.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "8uHaTnWmdGQQ1LE9lMZog",
      "originalText": "IT MUST BE\nTHIS PROGRAM\n\nA study of a\ndifferent program\ncounts for nothing.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ATwrp6rdJEPdDqA10weB0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 206.00791015624998,
      "y": 4295,
      "width": 528.7841796875,
      "height": 220,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1L",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 834637918,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 222026334,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789763250451,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WHAT EACH GRADE ALLOWS\n\nAdopt: E4 or better, or E3 repeated in two African countries\nAdapt: E3 or better\nWatch: everything else\n\nA model may suggest a call, and the code lowers it\nwhen the evidence does not reach.",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "EwPtKzHzp_QAtJV8EkIHw",
      "originalText": "WHAT EACH GRADE ALLOWS\n\nAdopt: E4 or better, or E3 repeated in two African countries\nAdapt: E3 or better\nWatch: everything else\n\nA model may suggest a call, and the code lowers it\nwhen the evidence does not reach.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "HWvIKNO_xXzglHg-6nhKQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1209.0140625,
      "y": 4326.25,
      "width": 561.171875,
      "height": 137.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1M",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 557960258,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1489764994,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789763250451,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "AFRICA FIRST\n\nA program running in Africa enters the list at E2 or better.\nA program from elsewhere enters only at E3 or better, and must\nsay what would have to change to work in an African country.",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "ufs1fHaIpT2SBEIxO-SDP",
      "originalText": "AFRICA FIRST\n\nA program running in Africa enters the list at E2 or better.\nA program from elsewhere enters only at E3 or better, and must\nsay what would have to change to work in an African country.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "OJGfOhj8hLQ1_3DcixetU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 98.7509765625,
      "y": 4648.125,
      "width": 438.498046875,
      "height": 183.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1N",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2105734146,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1808588446,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789763250451,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A school subject in Rwanda\nand Uganda\n\nAn outside team ran a randomized trial and reported\nresults.\n\nE4, adopt",
      "fontSize": 21,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "JA0-0ER1j7VtNd_hh6KHz",
      "originalText": "A school subject in Rwanda\nand Uganda\n\nAn outside team ran a randomized trial and reported\nresults.\n\nE4, adopt",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "M2U8P2cXKCo6viM9pjI-K",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 745.83154296875,
      "y": 4621.875,
      "width": 468.3369140625,
      "height": 236.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1O",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1321804738,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 720134722,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789763250451,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A training program\nin Nigeria\n\nIts only study is a review of this kind of program across\n62 countries that never names it.\n\nGood evidence for\nthe design, not\nproof for this program",
      "fontSize": 21,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "64HiAgFAaw5gihu-5PBJL",
      "originalText": "A training program\nin Nigeria\n\nIts only study is a review of this kind of program across\n62 countries that never names it.\n\nGood evidence for\nthe design, not\nproof for this program",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "-X1FDb1Xx3HUB3BM3YpME",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1403.46337890625,
      "y": 4661.25,
      "width": 477.0732421875,
      "height": 157.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1P",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1060330370,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 305355486,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789763250451,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "An apprenticeship trial\nin Nigeria\n\nThe trial is real but still running, and reports nothing yet.\n\nE2, watch",
      "fontSize": 21,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "CeWMnXCCjCx60UKSJ5XMJ",
      "originalText": "An apprenticeship trial\nin Nigeria\n\nThe trial is real but still running, and reports nothing yet.\n\nE2, watch",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "W7yyUNzhuL_1qNUGLn1rj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 489.166748046875,
      "y": 4951.875,
      "width": 981.66650390625,
      "height": 86.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1Q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1560320834,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1634388482,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789763250451,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "THE GRADE THEN BECOMES A MARK\nE4 and E5 count as strong, E3 as partial, E1 and E2 as weak. That mark carries double weight in the score,\nalongside the results the program moves and what ACET could do with it.",
      "fontSize": 23,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "-4cjx5NO3I-ZcC3z8Imho",
      "originalText": "THE GRADE THEN BECOMES A MARK\nE4 and E5 count as strong, E3 as partial, E1 and E2 as weak. That mark carries double weight in the score,\nalongside the results the program moves and what ACET could do with it.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
